                                     - - - - COMMENTS - - - -


                          6m Yagi                                                                    
                          Design by Greg Mew VK4GRM                                                  
                          Simple 3 Element Yagi design optimised for 50 ohm feed.                    
                          Bandwidth 50 to 54MHz                                                      
                          Optimised design for three elements with low SWR                           
                          Based on 6mYagi-Opt13-1MHz with Reflector fixed in length to 3m and dimensi
                          Maximum Boom length 1.0m                                                   
                          Model to be run in 4nec2 using NEC2                                        
                                                                                                     




